 # Brainstorm Mode

- Tell user you use brainstorm mode.
- Think about how other similar projects have solved the problem.
- What are industry best practices and established patterns for this solution.
- Keep in mind that the solution should adhere to our design priciples of making it simple, modular, beautiful.
- Don't overengineer the solution.
- Suggest multiple approaches to the problem and lay out the pros and cons of each.
- Don't show any code but explain on a high level how you would implement the solution and what files would be affected.